Feature: The advisor
  A person who commands a team has an advisor. The advisor looks at the map of the team once
  each second. It speaks only when something matters. It does not speak when all is well.

  Four things matter. An enemy drone comes near a tower that the team holds. The team loses a
  tower. A drone of the team is down. The clock runs out and the team is behind. The advisor
  uses only the map of the team, as the computer commander does. Thus it does not know about an
  enemy drone in the fog.

  The advisor says each thing one time. It says it again only after 30 s, if it is still true.
  Thus the person is not told the same thing over and over.

  Expectation: The advisor is quiet when nothing matters
    Given the Red scout is at its base
    And the time left is 600 s
    When the advisor of Blue looks
    Then the advice of Blue is none

  Expectation: The advisor warns of an enemy drone near a tower that the team holds
    Given the Red scout is near the Blue home tower
    And the time left is 600 s
    When the advisor of Blue looks
    Then the advice of Blue is a tower is in danger

  Expectation: The advisor says a danger one time
    Overrides: The advisor warns of an enemy drone near a tower that the team holds
    The first look gives the advice. The next look, one second later, is quiet.

    Given the Red scout is near the Blue home tower
    And the time left is 600 s
    When the advisor of Blue looks twice
    Then the advice of Blue is none

  Expectation: The advisor says a danger again after 30 seconds
    Overrides: The advisor says a danger one time
    Given the Red scout is near the Blue home tower
    And the time left is 600 s
    When the advisor of Blue looks, and again 31 seconds later
    Then the advice of Blue is a tower is in danger

  Expectation: The advisor tells the team that it lost a tower
    A team knows that it lost a tower only if it sees the tower. A drone sees the tower from 130 m,
    outside the radio shadow of the tower.

    Given the towers held by Blue are 2
    And the west tower is held by Blue
    And the first Blue drone is 130 m from the west tower
    And the Red scout is at its base
    And the time left is 600 s
    When Red takes the west tower while the advisor of Blue watches
    Then the advice of Blue is a tower is lost

  Expectation: The advisor tells the team that a drone is down
    Given the batteries are on
    And the Red scout is at its base
    And the time left is 600 s
    And the battery of the first Blue drone is 5 s
    And the first Blue drone is low in the mid lane
    When the advisor of Blue looks after 10 seconds of play
    Then the advice of Blue is a drone is down

  Expectation: The advisor tells a team that is behind when the clock runs out
    Given the Red scout is at its base
    And the time left is 50 s
    And the score of Blue is 100 points
    And the score of Red is 200 points
    When the advisor of Blue looks
    Then the advice of Blue is the team is behind

  Expectation: The advisor does not tell a team that is ahead when the clock runs out
    Overrides: The advisor tells a team that is behind when the clock runs out
    Given the Red scout is at its base
    And the time left is 50 s
    And the score of Blue is 200 points
    And the score of Red is 100 points
    When the advisor of Blue looks
    Then the advice of Blue is none
